  ['MAINT_TEETH 24 on the flange, 35 on the ring · two pawls π apart = 12 pitches, so they act in unison']: 'MAINT_TEETH フランジ 24、環 35 · つめ二つが π = 12 ピッチ差 — つまり同時に働く',
