  ['setting (alarm crown pulled)']: '合わせ（アラームりゅうず引き出し）',
  ['The drop is a pure function of alignment, recomputed every tick — nothing accumulates (<code>alarmPinDropNow</code>, <code>main.js:14697</code>). The floor spans <code>gapHalf − pinArcHalf = 0.024 rad</code> either side of coincidence — about 2.76 min of the 12-hour disc, the source of the ring window. With the crown pulled, the §45 silence rocker\'s finger captures the tail at its rest height: <code>alarmPinDropPhys = min(law, cap)</code> with the cap at exactly 0 — the notch passes underneath and the pin stays on its riding seat. Releasing the hold onto a still-present notch counts as a fresh drop, so un-silencing mid-window rings once. The linkage that closes that finger is plate 4.']: '落下は整列の純関数で、毎刻み再計算 — 何も蓄積しません（<code>alarmPinDropNow</code>、<code>main.js:14697</code>）。床は一致の両側 <code>gapHalf − pinArcHalf = 0.024 rad</code> — 12 時間円板の約 2.76 分、鳴動窓の源です。りゅうずを引くと §45 の消音ロッカーの指が尾を静止高で捕らえます：<code>alarmPinDropPhys = min(law, cap)</code>、蓋はちょうど 0 — 切り欠きは下を通過し、ピンは乗り座に留まります。まだそこにある切り欠きへの保持の解除は新しい落下と数えられ、窓の途中の消音解除は一度鳴ります。その指を閉じるリンク仕掛けは図版 4 です。',
